/T (Figure 2 summarises how the limitations arise. A basic low-code application, characterised by quick development, minimal configuration and suitability for small and medium needs, faces growing enterprise requirements: more users and data, complex business processes, integration with multiple systems and higher security and compliance needs. These lead to enterprise-scale challenges such as increased complexity, higher performance demands, greater integration needs, stronger security and governance, and more customisation and flexibility. The diagram then identifies eight key limitations, which are the ones discussed above.)
